## February 2026: Documents and eligibility validation
{{< imagecaption image="/images/masters-application-timeline-2026/2.jpg" alt="Description" caption="Photo by Rodion Kutsaiev on Unsplash" width="600px" >}}

By February, you should be clear on what are the missing elements for your application.

As documents are uploaded and reviewed, gaps appear. Missing credit details. Unclear module names. Degrees that look fine in your own country but need clarification in Germany.

Edvi helps surface these all issues early, when there is still time to react. You will already get a list of required documents and the necessary steps you need to fill the gaps.

This is also when students with borderline GPAs or partial subject matches adjust strategy instead of hoping for exceptions.

By the end of February, strong applications share one trait:  
**nothing in them is ambiguous anymore**.

Germany does not tolerate ambiguity.

